:: Trash Mammals

<<set $location to "landfill">>

<<set $outside to 0>>

<<effects>>

<<if $dencounter is 0>>

	You carefully enter the clearing, curious about the movement you just saw. Once you're fully inside, a smell not dissimilar to a wet dog assaults your faculties. Suddenly, a chittering sound echoes in the area. The sound is replicated soon after, followed by another. The source of the cacophony becomes apparent as you are approached by a <<beasttype>>. Others approach you from the dark recesses of the den. They slowly surround you, blocking any hope of escape.
	<br><br>
	<<if $monster is 1>>
		"...Our den. Not yours," the one in front of you states. <<bHe>> makes a motion towards <<bhis>> companions. They begin to close in. "You can leave, but..." 
		<br><br>
		<<bHe>> suddenly pounces on you, knocking you down. "We take something first. Fair trade for entering." <<bHe>> grasps your body. "No struggle. Will be quick. Maybe you... like."
		<br><br>
	<</if>>


	<<link [[Next|Raccoons Rape]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><<set $dencounter to 1>><</link>><br>

<<else>>

	You carefully enter the clearing, wary of the denizens within. Once you're fully inside, the smell from last time invades your nostrils. Suddenly, a familiar chittering sound echoes in the area. The sound is replicated soon after, followed by another. The source of the cacophony becomes apparent as you are approached by a <<beasttype>>. Others approach you from the dark recesses of the den. They slowly surround you, blocking any hope of escape. <<bHis>> nose twitches, then <<bhis>> tail begins to wag feverishly. <<bHis>> eyes seem to sparkle with recognition and <<bhe>> bounds over to you, companions following.
	<br><br>
	<<if $monster is 1>>
		"...You again. You know this our home, but you still come," the one in front of you states. "This time, you want it." <<bHis>> companions approach you, not even waiting for the leader's command.
		<br><br>
		<<bHe>> suddenly pounces on you, knocking you down. "Well... we think you want it. You get it, either way." <<bHe>> grasps your body. "Easy way. Hard way. No matter. Still have fun. How you want it?"
		<br><br>
	<</if>>

	<<if $deviancy gte 35>>
	<<link [[Submit|Raccoons Love]]>><<set $sexstart to 1>><</link>><<deviant2>>
	<br>
	<</if>>
	<<link [[Resist|Raccoons Rape]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
	<br>

<</if>>


:: Raccoons Love

<<if $sexstart is 1>>
	<<set $sexstart to 0>>
	<<consensual>>
	<<set $consensual to 1>>
	<<neutral 1>>
	<<beastCombatInit>>
	<<beastTrainGenerate>>
	<span class='lewd'>"Everyone, just... let's not get too wild right away," You say. "Alright?"</span>
	<br><br>
	<<if $monster is 1>>
		The lead <<beasttype>> acknowledges your request. "No worry. We all enjoy this. You make good choice."
	<<else>>
		The lead <<beasttype>> licks you, as if sensing your trepidation.
	<</if>>
	<<set $NPCList[0].stance to "top">>
	<<if $raccoon gte 4>>
		<<deviancy1>>
	<<else>>
		<<deviancy4>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>

<<effects>>
<<effectsman>>
<<beast $enemyno>>
<<stateman>>
<<actionsman>>

