	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Raccoons Love Ejaculation]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<<else>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Raccoons Love]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<</if>>



:: Raccoons Love Ejaculation

<<effects>>
<<beastejaculation>>


<<if $combatTrain.length gt 0>>
	Satisfied, the <<beasttype>> leaves you be. Another takes its place.
	<<combatTrainAdvance>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Raccoons Love]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
	Satisfied, the <<beasttype>> leaves you be.
	<<combatTrainAdvance>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Raccoons Love Finish]]>><</link>>
<</if>>


:: Raccoons Love Finish


<<effects>>

<<if $enemyarousal gte $enemyarousalmax>>

	<<beastejaculation>>

	The <<beasttype>> lays on top of you for a moment before sliding off. The leader nuzzles you as <<bhe>> does so.
	<br><br>
	<<if $monster is 1>>
		"Was easy, yes? You just rest. We take care of everything." The leader gestures towards <<bhis>> companions. They return to the side of the one in charge.
		<br><br>
		"Still... too tired for more. Friends too, probably. Come back later. We have more fun." The <<beastsplural>> leave you. Presumably, to rest within the corners of the den.
		<br><br>
	<</if>>

	You slowly get up and brush yourself off. You give a curt nod to the group before departing.
	<br><br>

	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>

<<elseif $enemyhealth lte 0>>

	In your struggle, you manage to accidently get a clean hit on the <<beasttype>>.
	<br> 
	You press your advantage and shrug of the others while they're still surprised. 
	<br><br>
	<<if $monster is 1>>
		"Urgh! What...?" The <<beasttype>> yells as <<bhe>> and <<bhis>> companions are thrown off by your unexpected violence.
		<br><br>
		"You... change mind?" The leader questions as <<bhe>> nurses a bruise. "N...Now we do this hard wa-"
		<br><br>
		Your sudden movement catches <<bhim>> off-guard.
		<br><br>
	<</if>>

	<<tearful>> you dart out of the den entrance before the <<beasttypes>> have a chance to fully recover.
	<br><br>

	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>

<<else>>


	The <<beasttype>> lays on top of you for a moment before sliding off.
	<br><br>
	<<if $monster is 1>>
		"Was easy, yes? You just rest. We take care of everything." The leader gestures towards <<bhis>> companions. They return to the side of the one in charge.
		<br><br>
		"Still... too tired for more. Friends too, probably. Come back later. We have more fun." The <<beastsplural>> leave you. Presumably, to rest within the corners of the den.
		<br><br>
	<</if>>

	You slowly get up and brush yourself off. You give a curt nod to the group before departing.
	<br><br>

	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>

<</if>>

