:: Raccoons Rape End

<<effects>>
<<if $enemywounded is 1 and $enemyejaculated is 0>>
	The <<beasttype>> whimpers and flees into the darkness.
<<elseif $enemywounded is 0 and $enemyejaculated is 1>>
	The <<beasttype>> leaves you lying on the ground.
	<br><br>
	<<if $monster is 1>>
		"Was easy, yes? You just rest. We take care of everything." The leader gestures towards <<bhis>> companions. They return to the side of the one in charge. "Maybe you come back again." 
		<br><br>
		<<bHis>> companions make a chittering noise oddly reminiscent of snickering. The leader maintains <<bhis>> composure, but you still sense an air of conceit emanating from <<bhim>>. "Now go. Unless you want more."
		<br><br>
	<</if>>
<<elseif $enemywounded gte 2 and $enemyejaculated is 0>>
	Feeling that you're more trouble than you're worth, the <<beastsplural>> flee into the darkness.
<<elseif $enemywounded is 0 and $enemyejaculated gte 2>>
	The <<beastsplural>> leave you spent and shivering on the ground.
	<br><br>
	<<if $monster is 1>>
		"Was easy, yes? You just rest. We take care of everything." The leader gestures towards <<bhis>> companions. They return to the side of the one in charge. "You probably not come back... but, would not mind if you do." 
		<br><br>
		<<bHis>> companions make a chittering noise oddly reminiscent of snickering. The leader maintains <<bhis>> composure, but you still sense an air of conceit emanating from <<bhim>>. "Now go. Unless you want more."
		<br><br>
	<</if>>
<<elseif $enemywounded gte 1 and $enemyejaculated gte 1>>
	The <<beastsplural>> leave you spent and shivering on the ground. One is slowed by a limp.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<tearful>> you rise to your feet and flee the den as fast as you can.
<br><br>
<<clotheson>>
<<endcombat>>


